# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Frontend build-time configuration
#
#  Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides (git-ignored).
#  In production, set these in the Vercel dashboard:
#      Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#  Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Public base URL of the API, INCLUDING the /api path segment.
#
# Local dev  → leave unset. The app falls back to "/api" and Vite's dev proxy
#              (vite.config.ts) forwards to http://localhost:3001.
#
# Production → set to your Hugging Face Space URL, e.g.
#              VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://yourname-movecheck.hf.space/api
#
# Note the Space hostname format: username and space name, lowercased, with
# "/" replaced by "-", on the .hf.space domain.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://yourname-movecheck.hf.space/api
